    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Box&nbsp;10.01</strong> Differential diagnosis of intraductal papillary neoplasm of the bile ducts</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "<p> Imported from 5th edition </p><p>Nakanuma Yasuni</p>",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"595\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Micropapillary biliary intraepithelial neoplasia (BilIN</strong>)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 30.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 30.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Microscopically recognizable lesions in the intrahepatic large bile ducts</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>&lt;&nbsp;3&nbsp;mm in height</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Consistently intermixed with flat or pseudopapillary BilIN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Intraductal tubulopapillary neoplasm</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 40.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cast-like lesion composed of densely packed neoplastic tubular glands in the duct</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Unequivocal architectural and cytological atypia (high-grade)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>No mucinous content, negative for MUC5AC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Intraductal polypoid metastasis from extrahepatic organs</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Metastasis from colorectal carcinoma is common</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
